 qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window,
 qml6-module-qtquick-shapes,
 qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
Description: console mode for your Linux desktop - the graphical application
 Open Couch hands the whole machine to Steam's gamescope session on the
 television and gives it back cleanly when you leave.
 .
 This package is the optional graphical application; everything it does can also
 be done from the command line with open-couch-engine, which it requires.
